<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-QMC, Ford in magnesium project-paper.</title>
<headline>RTRS-QMC, Ford in magnesium project-paper.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ford Motor Co will announce on Thursday that it has joined forces with Queensland Metals Corp to develop a magnesium metal smelter worth about A$700 million, The Australian Financial Review newspaper reported.</p>
</text>
